# Agent capture

Prompt and final-response capture is automatic via Cursor hooks in `.cursor/hooks.json`. Do not log turns by hand.

- Write captures only through `.cursor/hooks/capture.sh`.
- Do not edit, tidy, summarise, or delete entries in `.agent-logs/` after they are written.
- Do not add `.agent-logs/` to `.gitignore`.
- Do not put thinking, tool calls, diffs, or intermediate steps into the session log.
